# SPA fallback for React Router client-side routes (/about, /project/:id).
# Vite copies everything in public/ to the dist/ root at build time, so this
# ships with the static bundle. Real asset requests are served as-is; anything
# else returns index.html with a 200 so the router can handle it.
# This duplicates the rewrite rule in render.yaml so the site still routes
# correctly even if it was set up as a manual Static Site rather than a Blueprint.
/*  /index.html  200
